# wear/woman/wrap_hang: the wrap's skirt to the ankles: the wound edge as one fold falling from her right hip to her left ankle
# (a lit overlapping panel), the lit hem band (the edge region) and its outline row over her shoe tips; from behind the drape's
# end hangs down her back to the knee; it sways by whole rows, widens on the stride, flares in the run
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role garment wrap
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 5

